WEBVTT

00:31:27.143 --> 00:31:30.898
You're a more seasoned human being
that has better judgment

00:31:30.922 --> 00:31:34.920
and better experience
and better confidence.

00:31:36.133 --> 00:31:38.093
AG: This might be one of the reasons why

00:31:38.117 --> 00:31:41.092
older founders are actually
more successful than younger ones.

00:31:41.437 --> 00:31:43.983
In a study of several
million entrepreneurs,

00:31:44.007 --> 00:31:47.048
40-year-olds were more than twice
as likely as 25-year-olds

00:31:47.072 --> 00:31:48.737
to launch a successful start-up.

00:31:49.289 --> 00:31:51.428
And they were also
nearly a third more likely

00:31:51.452 --> 00:31:55.774
to be in the top 0.1 percent
of fastest-growing tech start-ups.

00:31:56.226 --> 00:31:59.311
Yes, sprinters sometimes
get lucky right out of the gate,

00:31:59.335 --> 00:32:02.046
but marathoners know how to persevere.